### Manual checks of the daily reminder job (VS Code "REST Client", or any tool that sends HTTP).
### Replace the host with http://localhost:3000 or your own deployment; put your CRON_SECRET in the last two requests.

@host = https://committeekeeper.vercel.app

### 1. No secret: refused (401)
GET {{host}}/api/cron/daily

### 2. Wrong secret: refused (401)
GET {{host}}/api/cron/daily
Authorization: Bearer not-the-secret

### 3. Right secret: runs (200 and a summary, or 503 if the server key is not set up yet)
GET {{host}}/api/cron/daily
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_CRON_SECRET

### 4. Right secret again, the same day: nothing is sent or logged a second time (emailed: 0, logged: 0)
GET {{host}}/api/cron/daily
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_CRON_SECRET
